<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Finish Line started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Finish Line started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said on Tuesday it started coverage of Finish Line Inc with an intermediate-term accumulate rating and a long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Mark Friedman said his earnings estimate for the fiscal year ended February 1998 was $0.97 per share and $1.25 per share for the year ended February 1999.</p>
<p>-- &quot;We think they have one of the better mall-based concepts, especially with the 10,000-square-foot stores they are opening,&quot; Friedman said.</p>
<p>-- He said the stock was trading at a reasonable valuation.</p>
<p>-- Finish Line shares rose 7/16 to 12-7/8.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk))</p>
